'''Hakon One-Eye''', a [[Skyrim:Nord|Nord]] [[Skyrim:CombatWarrior1H|warrior]], is an ancient hero currently residing in the [[Skyrim:Hall of Valor|Hall of Valor]] in [[Skyrim:Sovngarde (place)|Sovngarde]]. He was one of the warriors, along with [[Skyrim:Gormlaith Golden-Hilt|Gormlaith Golden-Hilt]] and [[Skyrim:Felldir the Old|Felldir the Old]], who fought against [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]], ultimately sending him forward through time using an [[Lore:Elder Scrolls|Elder Scroll]]. He and his compatriots later assist you in the final battle against Alduin in Sovngarde.

He wears a set of [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Armor|ancient Nord armor]] with matching [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Boots|boots]] and [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Gauntlets|gauntlets]]. He wields an [[Skyrim:Ancient Nord Battle Axe|ancient Nord battle axe]]. He knows the following [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shouts]]: [[Skyrim:Disarm|Disarm]], [[Skyrim:Dragonrend|Dragonrend]], [[Skyrim:Frost Breath|Frost Breath]], [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]], [[Skyrim:Whirlwind Sprint|Whirlwind Sprint]], along with the greater power [[Skyrim:Battle Cry|Battle Cry]].

